  '{"stages":[{"id":"list3_stage_1","title":"Listening - Module 1 (Stage 1)","duration_seconds":870,"description":"Module 1 gồm các dạng bài: Choose a Response, Conversation, Announcement, Academic Talk. Hoàn thành trong 14.5 phút.","tasks":[{"id":"list3_m1_t1","title":"Task 1: Listen & Choose a Response (8 câu)","task_type":"choose_response","content":{"instructions":"Lắng nghe câu nói ngắn và chọn phản xạ trả lời phù hợp nhất theo chuẩn giao tiếp đại học Bắc Mỹ.","questions":[{"id":"list3_m1_q1","type":"choose_response","audio_text":"Can you save me a seat in the lecture Can you save me a seat in the lecture Can you save me a seat in the lecture hall?","prompt":"Select the most appropriate response to what you heard:","options":{"C":"It''s in room 204.","A":"The lecture starts at noon.","B":"Sure, I''ll sit near the front.","D":"I already handed it in."},"correct_answer":"B","explanation":"Đáp án đúng là (B): \"Sure, I''ll sit near the front.\". Đây là câu phản xạ giao tiếp tự nhiên và chuẩn xác nhất theo ngữ cảnh văn hóa đại học Bắc Mỹ."},{"id":"list3_m1_q2","type":"choose_response","audio_text":"&gt;&gt; Do you know where the student health &gt;&gt; Do you know where the student health &gt;&gt; Do you know where the student health center is?","prompt":"Select the most appropriate response to what you heard:","options":{"C":"I forgot my ID card.","A":"It opens at nine.","B":"I think it''s next to the gym.","D":"She was absent yesterday."},"correct_answer":"B","explanation":"Đáp án đúng là (B): \"I think it''s next to the gym.\". Đây là câu phản xạ giao tiếp tự nhiên và chuẩn xác nhất theo ngữ cảnh văn hóa đại học Bắc Mỹ."},{"id":"list3_m1_q3","type":"choose_response","audio_text":"&gt;&gt; I''m worried I won''t finish the &gt;&gt; I''m worried I won''t finish the &gt;&gt; I''m worried I won''t finish the assignment on time.","prompt":"Select the most appropriate response to what you heard:","options":{"C":"Yes, the deadline is today.","A":"Try asking for an exten