ould we meet for the group Where should we meet for the group project?","prompt":"Select the most appropriate response to what you heard:","options":{"C":"I joined the club.","A":"It''s due next week.","B":"Let''s meet in the library study room.","D":"I''ll send the email tomorrow."},"correct_answer":"B","explanation":"Đáp án đúng là (B): \"Let''s meet in the library study room.\". Đây là câu phản xạ giao tiếp tự nhiên và chuẩn xác nhất theo ngữ cảnh văn hóa đại học Bắc Mỹ."},{"id":"list4_m2_q4","type":"choose_response","audio_text":"Where should we meet for the group project? Could you explain this word to me?","prompt":"Select the most appropriate response to what you heard:","options":{"C":"Sure, it means \"necessary.\"","A":"The text was difficult.","B":"I was absent last class.","D":"It would mean a world to me."},"correct_answer":"C","explanation":"Đáp án đúng là (C): \"Sure, it means \"necessary.\"\". Đây là câu phản xạ giao tiếp tự nhiên và chuẩn xác nhất theo ngữ cảnh văn hóa đại học Bắc Mỹ."},{"id":"list4_m2_q5","type":"choose_response","audio_text":"Could you explain this word to me? Is the sports center open on Sundays?","prompt":"Select the most appropriate response to what you heard:","options":{"C":"I already bought my ticket.","A":"The team is practicing.","B":"Yes, but only until 6 p.m.","D":"No, it''s very cheap."},"correct_answer":"B","explanation":"Đáp án đúng là (B): \"Yes, but only until 6 p.m.\". Đây là câu phản xạ giao tiếp tự nhiên và chuẩn xác nhất theo ngữ cảnh văn hóa đại học Bắc Mỹ."},{"id":"list4_m2_q6","type":"choose_response","audio_text":"Is the sports center open on Sundays? Did you like the guest speaker talk?","prompt":"Select the most appropriate response to what you heard:","options":{"C":"I didn''t invite him.","A":"They''re in the office.","B":"No, I missed the bus.","D":"Yes, it was inspiring."},"correct_answer":"D","explanation":"Đáp án đúng là (D): \"Yes, it was inspiring.\". Đây là câu phản xạ giao tiếp tự nhiên và chuẩn x