  '{"stages":[{"id":"list6_stage_1","title":"Listening - Module 1 (Stage 1)","duration_seconds":870,"description":"Module 1 gồm các dạng bài: Choose a Response, Conversation, Announcement, Academic Talk. Hoàn thành trong 14.5 phút.","tasks":[{"id":"list6_m1_t1","title":"Task 1: Listen & Choose a Response (8 câu)","task_type":"choose_response","content":{"instructions":"Lắng nghe câu nói ngắn và chọn phản xạ trả lời phù hợp nhất theo chuẩn giao tiếp đại học Bắc Mỹ.","questions":[{"id":"list6_m1_q1","type":"choose_response","audio_text":"you will answer 40 to 50 questions to demonstrate how well you understand demonstrate how well you understand demonstrate how well you understand spoken English. There are four types of spoken English. There are four types of spoken English. There are four types of tasks. You will hear the audios only tasks. You will hear the audios only tasks. You will hear the audios only once. You will not be able to return to","prompt":"Select the most appropriate response to what you heard:","options":{"C":"Finals are stressful.","A":"In the online system.","B":"I worked alone.","D":"The project is hard."},"correct_answer":"A","explanation":"Đáp án đúng là (A): \"In the online system.\". Đây là câu phản xạ giao tiếp tự nhiên và chuẩn xác nhất theo ngữ cảnh văn hóa đại học Bắc Mỹ."},{"id":"list6_m1_q2","type":"choose_response","audio_text":"questions in the first module correctly, you will advance to the hard second you will advance to the hard second you will advance to the hard second module. In this practice test, the module. In this practice test, the module. In this practice test, the second module is hard. second module is hard. second module is hard. Module one.","prompt":"Select the most appropriate response to what you heard:","options":{"C":"My schedule is busy.","A":"History is compulsory.","B":"Electives are optional.","D":"You could ask your advisor."},"correct_answer":"D","explanation":"Đáp án đúng là (D): \"You could ask your advisor.\". Đây là câu phản xạ giao tiếp tự nhiên và chuẩn xác nhất theo ngữ cảnh văn hóa đại học Bắc Mỹ."},{"id":"list6_m1_q3","type":"choose_response","audio_text":"Module one. Where do we submit the final project?","prompt":"Select the most appropriate response to what you heard:","options":{"C":"Yes, on the first floor.","A":"The library is quiet.","B":"It closes early.","D":"I like coffee."},"correct_answer":"C","explanation":"Đáp án đúng là (C): \"Yes, on the first floor.\". Đây là câu phản xạ giao tiếp tự nhiên và chuẩn xác nhất theo ngữ cảnh văn hóa đại học Bắc Mỹ."},{"id":"list6_m1_q4","type":"choose_response","audio_text":"I''m not sure which elective to choose.","prompt":"Select the most appropriate response to what you heard:","options":{"C":"I can tell you what it was about.","A":"Announcements are boring.","B":"She wasn''t listening.","D":"The class you missed was full."},"correct_answer":"C","explanation":"Đáp án đúng là (C): \"I can tell you what it was about.\". Đây là câu phản xạ giao tiếp tự nhiên và chuẩn xác nhất theo ngữ cảnh văn hóa đại học Bắc Mỹ."},{"id":"list6_m1_q5","type":"choose_response","audio_text":"Is there a cafe near the library?","prompt":"Select the most appropriate response to what you heard:","options":{"C":"Maybe the printers are broken.","A":"I don''t have paper.","B":"The assignment is long.","D":"No, digital submission is fine."},"correct_answer":"D","explanation":"Đáp án đúng là (D): \"No, digital submission is fine.\". Đây là câu phản xạ giao tiếp tự nhiên và chuẩn xác nhất theo ngữ cảnh văn hóa đại học Bắc Mỹ."},{"id":"list6_m1_q6","type":"choose_response","audio_text":"I missed the announcement in class.","prompt":"Select the most appropriate response to what you heard:","options":{"C":"Recordings take time.","A":"The lecture was long.","B":"For students who were absent.","D":"The sound was bad."},"correct_answer":"B","explanation":"Đáp án đúng là (B): \"For students who were absent.\". Đây là câu phản xạ giao tiếp tự nhiên v