  '{"stages":[{"id":"list7_stage_1","title":"Listening - Module 1 (Stage 1)","duration_seconds":870,"description":"Module 1 gồm các dạng bài: Choose a Response, Conversation, Announcement, Academic Talk. Hoàn thành trong 14.5 phút.","tasks":[{"id":"list7_m1_t1","title":"Task 1: Listen & Choose a Response (8 câu)","task_type":"choose_response","content":{"instructions":"Lắng nghe câu nói ngắn và chọn phản xạ trả lời phù hợp nhất theo chuẩn giao tiếp đại học Bắc Mỹ.","questions":[{"id":"list7_m1_q1","type":"choose_response","audio_text":"you will answer 40 to 50 questions to demonstrate how well you understand demonstrate how well you understand demonstrate how well you understand spoken English. There are four types of spoken English. There are four types of spoken English. There are four types of tasks. You will hear the audios only tasks. You will hear the audios only tasks. You will hear the audios only once. You will not be able to return to","prompt":"Select the most appropriate response to what you heard:","options":{"C":"I''m a real bookworm.","A":"They weigh a ton.","B":"Sure, where are you headed?","D":"The library is closed for the day."},"correct_answer":"B","explanation":"Đáp án đúng là (B): \"Sure, where are you headed?\". Đây là câu phản xạ giao tiếp tự nhiên và chuẩn xác nhất theo ngữ cảnh văn hóa đại học Bắc Mỹ."},{"id":"list7_m1_q2","type":"choose_response","audio_text":"if you answer 60% or more of the questions in the first module correctly, questions in the first module correctly, questions in the first module correctly, you will advance to the hard second you will advance to the hard second you will advance to the hard second module. In this practice test, the module. In this practice test, the module. In this practice test, the second module is hard. second module is hard. second module is hard. Module one.","prompt":"Select the most appropriate response to what you heard:","options":{"C":"Yes, it''s open until midnight.","A":"It''s got state-of-the-art computers.","B":"It''s always packed like sardines.","D":"I hardly ever set foot there."},"correct_answer":"C","explanation":"Đáp án đúng là (C): \"Yes, it''s open until midnight.\". Đây là câu phản xạ giao tiếp tự nhiên và chuẩn xác nhất theo ngữ cảnh văn hóa đại học Bắc Mỹ."},{"id":"list7_m1_q3","type":"choose_response","audio_text":"Module one. Can you help me carry these books?","prompt":"Select the most appropriate response to what you heard:","options":{"C":"I skimmed through the article.","A":"That might cost you some points.","B":"Sources are the backbone of any paper.","D":"The paper is a real marathon."},"correct_answer":"A","explanation":"Đáp án đúng là (A): \"That might cost you some points.\". Đây là câu phản xạ giao tiếp tự nhiên và chuẩn xác nhất theo ngữ cảnh văn hóa đại học Bắc Mỹ."},{"id":"list7_m1_q4","type":"choose_response","audio_text":"Is the computer lab open late?","prompt":"Select the most appropriate response to what you heard:","options":{"C":"Choosing a career is a big deal.","A":"It was crowded.","B":"I''m on the hunt for a job.","D":"Yes, I had a word with two companies."},"correct_answer":"D","explanation":"Đáp án đúng là (D): \"Yes, I had a word with two companies.\". Đây là câu phản xạ giao tiếp tự nhiên và chuẩn xác nhất theo ngữ cảnh văn hóa đại học Bắc Mỹ."},{"id":"list7_m1_q5","type":"choose_response","audio_text":"I forgot to cite my sources.","prompt":"Select the most appropriate response to what you heard:","options":{"C":"Exams always make me nervous.","A":"I used to study there.","B":"The room was tiny.","D":"Thanks for the heads-up."},"correct_answer":"D","explanation":"Đáp án đúng là (D): \"Thanks for the heads-up.\". Đây là câu phản xạ giao tiếp tự nhiên và chuẩn xác nhất theo ngữ cảnh văn hóa đại học Bắc Mỹ."},{"id":"list7_m1_q6","type":"choose_response","audio_text":"Did you attend the career fair? The exam room was changed.","prompt":"Select the most appropriate response to what you heard:","options":{"C":"The class drags on.","A":"The early bird catches the worm.","B":"I wrapped up my work ahead of time.","D":"I''m a morning person."},"correct_answer":"B","explanation":"Đáp án đúng là (B): \"I wrapped up my work ahead of time.\". Đây là câu phản xạ giao tiếp tự nhiên và chuẩn xác nhất theo ngữ cảnh văn hóa đại học Bắc Mỹ."},{"id":"list7_m1_q7","type":"choose_response","audio_text":"The exam room was changed. Why are you leaving early?","prompt":"Select the most appropriate response to what you heard:","options":{"C":"I usually go it alone.","A":"Two heads are better than one.","B":"I''d love that.","D":"The group is already full."},"correct_answer":"B","explanation":"Đáp án đúng là (B): \"I''d love that.\". Đây là câu phản xạ giao tiếp tự nhiên và chuẩn xác nhất theo ngữ cảnh văn hóa đại học Bắc Mỹ."},{"id":"list7_m1_q8","type":"choose_response","audio_text":"Why are you leaving early? Do you want to join our study group?","prompt":"Select the most appropriate response to what you heard:","options":{"C":"It''s in Building C, just around the corner.","A":"That building is hard to miss.","B":"I''m running behind schedule.","D":"Finding classrooms can be a maze."},"correct_answer":"C","explanation":"Đáp án đúng là (C): \"It''s in Building C, just around the corner.\". Đây là câu phản xạ giao tiếp tự nhiên và chuẩn xác nhất theo ngữ cảnh văn hóa đại học Bắc Mỹ."}]}},{"id":"list7_m1_t2","title":"Task 2: Campus Conversation 1","task_type":"conversation","content":{"context_title":"Hội thoại sinh viên 1","audio_text":"Do you want to join our study group? I can''t find my classroom. Listen to a conversation. Listen to a conversation. Listen to a conversation. Did you order already? Not yet. I was Did you order already? Not yet. I was Did you order already? Not yet. I was waiting for you. Thanks. I think I''ll waiting for you. Thanks. I think I''ll waiting for you. Thanks. I think I''ll get the soup and salad. Good choice. get the soup and salad. Good choice. get the soup and s